# Д4.1, the pair of clips «оригинал | своё»: Harad (VLK_412_HARAD) at the anvil, ZS_SMITH_ANVIL.
# By default the occupation runs from its record in the base; OPENGOTHIC_ACTIVITY_RECORDS=0 films the same through
# the VM. His routine: fire 10:00-10:10, anvil 10:10-10:20, fire again. World time runs 14.5x: 10 game minutes ~ 41 s,
# so the minute of the clip shows him leave the fire, walk to the anvil, work and walk back at the end of the row.
# A fixed camera over the smithy yard (fire NW_CITY_SMITH_FIRE on the left, anvil in front), the hero out of view.
# @timeout 600
seed 73106
cheat god
overlay off
set time 10 8
goto pos 6800 300 -2100
watch VLK_412_HARAD
wait 3000
cam at 6350 500 -1350 5720 320 -1260
wait 500
shot start
rec anvil
wait 60000
stop
shot end
wait 1000
